{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>A.L.A.R.M.</i>, you awaken in a fractured world where the line between technology and biology has dissolved. The living-tech relic known as the <strong>Nodus</strong> binds you to the earth itself; a tool, a weapon, and a curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform, build, and survive through evolving biomes shaped by your touch. Every action alters the land and shifts your standing among allies and enemies alike. Forge connections with unpredictable companions whose trust and respect determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equal parts survival, exploration, and emergent narrative, <i>A.L.A.R.M.</i> fuses voxel terraforming, cyber-horror aesthetics, and matriarchal revolution into one adaptive, living world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Absurd, eerie charm where horror and humor hold hands and skip through a minefield.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER DYNAMIC ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack, Slash, and Dance \u2013 Chain Shinobi-inspired acrobatics with rhythmic assassinations in Dansassination, where enemies are mesmerized into a deadly choreography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinity-based Combat \u2013 Your style influences your strength, outfits grant affinities like Brave, Melancholy, or Dazzle, affecting abilities and resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized Combat Styles \u2013 Wield distinct skill trees, from bladed precision to Arquanum-infused devastation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Unholy \u2013 Battle Mist Maidens, cybernetic monstrosities, and Victor\u2019s Generals-each a boss fight of surreal horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANSASSINATION \u2013 MURDER SET TO MUSIC</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn combat into a hypnotic dance, summon backup dancers, chain executions, and slaughter in perfect rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the beat, break the illusion, one mistake, and the massacre turns mutual.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraforming / Nodus Sculpting</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape terrain in real time using the Nodus \u2014 a living biotech tool bound to you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, build, smooth, and level to form paths, shelters, caverns, and platforms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvested earth becomes usable material \u2014 no wasted steps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create cozy hideouts, fortified bases, or sprawling land bridges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world responds to your intent \u2014 not prefab templates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; CONTROL SYNDI CITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your hidden stronghold; your rebel city built from ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild homes, markets, and safe havens, attract allies and anger Olivia, the vengeful General.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Syndi City\u2019s power base;\u00a0choose how your faction rises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND ALLIES, UNLOCK COMPANIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glim, your constant companion, provides insight, support, and unexpected truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit legendary allies: assassins, rebels, and outcasts, each with unique combat styles, personalities, and personal quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tag-team combat; chain unique abilities with companions for devastating effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN AUTISTIC ASSASSIN\u2019S WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Draven\u2019s world through sensory overload, hyper-focus, and heightened perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns emerge, the battlefield shifts, reality bends, but too much stimulation can be deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to an autistic perspective in combat, dialogue, and exploration.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD OF CYBERPUNK NIGHTMARES &amp; ARQUANUM MYSTERIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Ruins is a twisted blend of Cyberpunk, Silent Hill, and The Island of Doctor Moreau.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is fragile; Arquanum bends time and space, revealing hidden paths and altering fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Doctor Bones Morrow, the mad scientist behind Arquanum, and Victor Von Baron, the gluttonous, undead CEO of Canopy Corp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOVERBOARDING, STUNTS &amp; UNDERGROUND RACES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through ruins on an Arquanum powered hoverboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind, vault, and assassinate mid-air-style meets lethality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high stakes races and trick-based minigames in the Hoverboard Park.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 KILLER OUTFITS FOR KILLER MOVES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Draven\u2019s identity, customize appearance, face morphs, and attire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is power. Each outfit grants unique combat affinities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinities define your style. Each outfit unlocks unique combat affinities that enhance abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop at Assassin\u2019s R Us, where the motto is: Killer outfits for Killer moves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>PLAYER CHOICE: SUBVERT OR SLAUGHTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert or Eradicate \u2013 Will you manipulate the Patriarchy\u2019s ranks or wipe them out?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Morality \u2013 Your actions reshape Star Ruins, factions shift, allies react, and the final battle\u2019s outcome is yours to dictate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The World is in ruins. The dance of death has begun. <br>Will you lead the rebellion or be lost in the mist?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416290?t=1773144948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/3e8b3153208d4ca014fbfc4121cac5fcd706cdac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773144948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/a2e8e1e22eb1e16b677eebd271b41d9fc95c6e83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773144948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/a2e8e1e22eb1e16b677eebd271b41d9fc95c6e83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773144948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"A.L.A.R.M. contains stylized but impactful violence, dark humor, and occasional crude language used for comedic or expressive purposes.\r\n\r\nViolence & Gore \u2013 Combat is fast-paced, exaggerated, and creative, with blood effects and the occasional over-the-top finishing move. Some attacks may include low blows or humorous takedowns.\r\n\r\nDrugs & Alcohol \u2013 Characters may consume alcohol, marijuana, psychedelic mushrooms, and other plant-based substances in ways that align with the game\u2019s satire and storytelling.\r\n\r\nTone & Style \u2013 While the game features high-quality PBR textures for realism, character designs are slightly stylized and expressive, balancing the intensity of combat with humor and satire.\r\n\r\nNo sexual content or nudity.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy cyber-horror, dark comedy, and high-energy action, A.L.A.R.M. delivers a unique and immersive experience-with a satirical twist."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>A.L.A.R.M.</i>, you awaken in a fractured world where the line between technology and biology has dissolved. The living-tech relic known as the <strong>Nodus</strong> binds you to the earth itself; a tool, a weapon, and a curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform, build, and survive through evolving biomes shaped by your touch. Every action alters the land and shifts your standing among allies and enemies alike. Forge connections with unpredictable companions whose trust and respect determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equal parts survival, exploration, and emergent narrative, <i>A.L.A.R.M.</i> fuses voxel terraforming, cyber-horror aesthetics, and matriarchal revolution into one adaptive, living world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Absurd, eerie charm where horror and humor hold hands and skip through a minefield.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/f7231b910551a35366f27bfe8e71f407.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER DYNAMIC ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack, Slash, and Dance \u2013 Chain Shinobi-inspired acrobatics with rhythmic assassinations in Dansassination, where enemies are mesmerized into a deadly choreography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinity-based Combat \u2013 Your style influences your strength, outfits grant affinities like Brave, Melancholy, or Dazzle, affecting abilities and resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialized Combat Styles \u2013 Wield distinct skill trees, from bladed precision to Arquanum-infused devastation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Unholy \u2013 Battle Mist Maidens, cybernetic monstrosities, and Victor\u2019s Generals-each a boss fight of surreal horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/2daa7ecf154df45a09d6c7f68a399a43.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANSASSINATION \u2013 MURDER SET TO MUSIC</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn combat into a hypnotic dance, summon backup dancers, chain executions, and slaughter in perfect rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the beat, break the illusion, one mistake, and the massacre turns mutual.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/8a611a0f340c80b1514b9155dab78793.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terraforming / Nodus Sculpting</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape terrain in real time using the Nodus \u2014 a living biotech tool bound to you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, build, smooth, and level to form paths, shelters, caverns, and platforms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvested earth becomes usable material \u2014 no wasted steps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create cozy hideouts, fortified bases, or sprawling land bridges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world responds to your intent \u2014 not prefab templates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/49b599b71b58c95885ffe875670a548e.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD &amp; CONTROL SYNDI CITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your hidden stronghold; your rebel city built from ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild homes, markets, and safe havens, attract allies and anger Olivia, the vengeful General.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Syndi City\u2019s power base;\u00a0choose how your faction rises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/5fdc1ccfc8335d1afdf21be425f06375.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND ALLIES, UNLOCK COMPANIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glim, your constant companion, provides insight, support, and unexpected truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit legendary allies: assassins, rebels, and outcasts, each with unique combat styles, personalities, and personal quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tag-team combat; chain unique abilities with companions for devastating effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/fcf13e604f1f069b1fcb78d6099d98b4.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN AUTISTIC ASSASSIN\u2019S WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Draven\u2019s world through sensory overload, hyper-focus, and heightened perception.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns emerge, the battlefield shifts, reality bends, but too much stimulation can be deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to an autistic perspective in combat, dialogue, and exploration.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD OF CYBERPUNK NIGHTMARES &amp; ARQUANUM MYSTERIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Ruins is a twisted blend of Cyberpunk, Silent Hill, and The Island of Doctor Moreau.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is fragile; Arquanum bends time and space, revealing hidden paths and altering fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face Doctor Bones Morrow, the mad scientist behind Arquanum, and Victor Von Baron, the gluttonous, undead CEO of Canopy Corp.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/d619085a3a91b616842a48c9eef7a20a.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOVERBOARDING, STUNTS &amp; UNDERGROUND RACES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through ruins on an Arquanum powered hoverboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind, vault, and assassinate mid-air-style meets lethality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on high stakes races and trick-based minigames in the Hoverboard Park.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/87c7357fdb8f5c92e5cbdc906ab88a71.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 KILLER OUTFITS FOR KILLER MOVES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Draven\u2019s identity, customize appearance, face morphs, and attire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is power. Each outfit grants unique combat affinities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinities define your style. Each outfit unlocks unique combat affinities that enhance abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop at Assassin\u2019s R Us, where the motto is: Killer outfits for Killer moves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>PLAYER CHOICE: SUBVERT OR SLAUGHTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert or Eradicate \u2013 Will you manipulate the Patriarchy\u2019s ranks or wipe them out?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Morality \u2013 Your actions reshape Star Ruins, factions shift, allies react, and the final battle\u2019s outcome is yours to dictate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.poster.avif?t=1773144948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.webm?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/extras/428fc42391c534aa07f0210c9f7a2c5a.mp4?t=1773144948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The World is in ruins. The dance of death has begun. <br>Will you lead the rebellion or be lost in the mist?</p>","developers":["TeeKru Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416290/8ce943d5a8e960a8f0f53cf47459ae398eb091e5/header.jpg?t=1773144948","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2026 TeeKru Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3416290/2028468665/90a8b564fdd2bc405aa6e685de2e37b8be16ade3/1764476452/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764479097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3416290/2028468665/90a8b564fdd2bc405aa6e685de2e37b8be16ade3/1764476452/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764479097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3416290/2028468665/90a8b564fdd2bc405aa6e685de2e37b8be16ade3/1764476452/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764479097","id":257240640,"name":"November - Inside TeeKru","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257240640/6f89893834807191a8a9f4de7c8a5503a5fc3faf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764479097"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.